{{Quote|Allows the user to instantly travel to any location, or create a portal to a dimension of their own.|Shop}}
'''Portal''' (formerly known as [[Door]]) is a {{Legendary}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|1,900,000}} or {{Robux|2,000}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Portal grants the user the ability to create portals, enabling instantaneous movement and teleportation across various set locations.
